flowchart TB
  V[Wearable vest]
  V --> CHEST[Protected chest enclosure: T-Call + controller]
  V --> BAT[Secured battery at waist / protected rear enclosure]
  V --> U[Upper IMU between shoulder blades]
  V --> P[Pelvis IMU on rear support]
  V --> ENV[SHT31 at ventilated shoulder location]
  V --> FB[Vibration motor at suitable body-contact point]
  V --> UI[Visible status LED + guarded SOS/cancel controls]
  V --> WR[Wrist mount: MAX30102 against bare skin]
  V --> LH[Detachable left instrumented handle]
  V --> RH[Detachable right instrumented handle]
  LH --> L[Load cell + HX711]
  RH --> R[Load cell + HX711]
